<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Admin</title><script src="https://cdn.socket.io/4.7.2/socket.io.min.js"></script><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Arial}body{background:#0b0c15;color:#fff;padding:12px}.box{background:#1a1c28;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #2a2c3d;margin-bottom:10px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:11px}th,td{padding:7px;border-bottom:1px solid #2a2c3d}input{width:100%;padding:11px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #333;background:#0f101a;color:#fff;margin:5px 0}</style></head><body>
<div id="log" style="max-width:340px;margin:40px auto"><div class="box" style="border-color:#e2136e"><h3 style="text-align:center;color:#e2136e">🔐 ADMIN LOGIN</h3><input id="p" placeholder="Password" type="password"><button onclick="if(document.getElementById('p').value==='99737'){document.getElementById('log').style.display='none';document.getElementById('pan').style.display='block'}" style="background:#e2136e;color:#fff;padding:11px;border:none;border-radius:8px;width:100%;font-weight:900">LOGIN</button><p style="font-size:10px;color:#666;text-align:center;margin-top:6px">Pass: 99737</p></div></div>
<div id="pan" style="display:none"><div class="box"><b style="color:#e2136e">💰 ADMIN PANEL - 01904599737</b><br><small>Game: aviator-demo-oo2b.onrender.com</small></div><div class="box"><b>📥 Deposit Live</b><p style="color:#888;font-size:11px">কেউ Deposit করলে এখানে দেখাবে</p><div id="dl"></div></div><div class="box"><b>📤 Withdraw Live</b><p style="color:#888;font-size:11px">কেউ Withdraw চাইলে এখানে দেখাবে</p><div id="wl"></div></div></div>
</body></html>
